  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your power enables you to achieve even greater effects while in Aristeia.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The maximum number of hero points you may have at a time increases by 1. When you enter Aristeia, you gain a single hero point. This hero point is expended automatically when you leave Aristeia, and cannot be used with the Heroic Perseverance feat. When you enter Aristeia level 3 or higher, you instead gain two hero points which are expended when you leave.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> This feat counts as Hero’s Fortune for the purpose of meeting prerequisites.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/aristeia-feats#toc21\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
